---
/** Client + Supplier Dashboard — the same trip, one view per side, neither
    seeing the other's. The supplier never sees the margin. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>Nairobi — 9 nights</b><small>Two sides · one record</small></div>
  <div class="mk-row2">
    <div>
      <span class="mk-lbl">Traveller's side</span>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Itinerary v3</b><small>9 nights · Mara North · Naboisho</small></div><span class="mk-chk"></span></div>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Total</b><small>2 travellers</small></div><span class="r">€4,932</span></div>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Deposit</b><small>Instructions on the link</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">Due 12 Jan</span></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="mk-lbl">Supplier's side</span>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Request</b><small>3 – 12 March · 2 pax</small></div><span class="mk-chk"></span></div>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Your quote</b><small>Received in full</small></div><span class="r">€4,180</span></div>
      <div class="mk-row plain"><div><b>Confirmation</b><small>Re-check sent</small></div><span class="mk-chk wait"></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <span class="mk-fine">No login on either side — each opens its own magic link.</span>
</div>
